{"id":69631,"date":"2025-10-08T08:07:21","date_gmt":"2025-10-08T07:07:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69631"},"modified":"2026-10-16T08:54:37","modified_gmt":"2026-10-16T07:54:37","slug":"trail-do-serrote","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-do-serrote\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail do Serrote 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail do Serrote 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail do Serrote 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong> (Domingo) em <strong>Vila Nova de Monsarros<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Anadia<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. Com toda a log\u00edstica de partida, meta, secretariado, banhos e conv\u00edvio concentrada no <strong>Campo e Pavilh\u00e3o Desportivo de Val das Cavadas<\/strong>, a prova leva-te a percorrer as terras altas, os vales encaixados e as aldeias serranas nas encostas ocidentais da Serra do Bu\u00e7aco.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Podes desafiar-te no <strong>Trail de 19 km<\/strong> (cerca de <strong>1100m D+<\/strong>, com partida \u00e0s 09:00), no <strong>Mini-Trail de 14 km<\/strong> (cerca de <strong>700m D+<\/strong>, tamb\u00e9m \u00e0s 09:00 em sa\u00edda din\u00e2mica) ou na <strong>Caminhada de 12 km<\/strong> (cerca de <strong>400m D+<\/strong>, com arranque \u00e0s 09:20 rumo \u00e0 festa na aldeia de <strong>Algeriz<\/strong>). O percurso oscila entre os 67 e os 320 metros de altitude, combinando subidas exigentes e descidas t\u00e9cnicas com abastecimentos tradicionais \u00e0 moda da aldeia e o famoso almo\u00e7o de bifana \u00e0 moda das Tr\u00eas Mentiras e caldo verde, num cora\u00e7\u00e3o da Bairrada c\u00e9lebre tamb\u00e9m pelo pr\u00e9mio de leit\u00e3o assado atribu\u00eddo \u00e0s maiores equipas.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural e Desportiva de Vila Nova de Monsarros<\/strong>, o evento inclui T-shirt t\u00e9cnica, dorsal com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, seguro desportivo, apoio da GNR e Bombeiros, banhos quentes e almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio a partir das 12:00, encerrando com a cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios \u00e0s 13:20.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=