:20 \u2022 400m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 14,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/12 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 16,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01 a 20\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 17,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (21\/02 a 08\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail do Serrote 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail do Serrote 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, com partida e chegada no Campo e Pavilh\u00e3o Desportivo de Val das Cavadas, em Vila Nova de Monsarros, concelho de Anadia (distrito de Aveiro).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento integra tr\u00eas provas: o Trail de 19 km (1100m D+) e o Mini-Trail de 14 km (700m D+), ambos com partida conjunta em sa\u00edda din\u00e2mica \u00e0s 09:00, e a Caminhada de 12 km (400m D+) com partida \u00e0s 09:20.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail do Serrote 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 8 de mar\u00e7o de 2027 em quatro fases: no Trail 19 km custam 18\u20ac (at\u00e9 30\/11\/2026), 20\u20ac (at\u00e9 31\/12\/2026), 21\u20ac (at\u00e9 20\/02\/2027) e 23\u20ac (at\u00e9 08\/03\/2027); no Mini-Trail 14 km variam entre 15\u20ac, 17\u20ac, 19\u20ac e 20\u20ac; e na Caminhada 12 km variam entre 14\u20ac, 15\u20ac, 16\u20ac e 17\u20ac.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e a que horas funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no Pavilh\u00e3o Desportivo de Val das Cavadas em Vila Nova de Monsarros no s\u00e1bado, 13 de mar\u00e7o, das 16:00 \u00e0s 19:00, e no domingo, dia da prova, das 07:30 \u00e0s 08:45.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui T-shirt oficial do evento, dorsal, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, dois abastecimentos no Trail (e um no Mini-Trail e Caminhada, com conv\u00edvio na aldeia de Algeriz), seguro desportivo, banhos e almo\u00e7o completo com bifana \u00e0 moda das Tr\u00eas Mentiras, caldo verde, bebida e caf\u00e9.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail do Serrote 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Vila Nova de Monsarros, Anadia\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Anadia\", \"addressRegion\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural e Desportiva de Vila Nova de Monsarros\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail do Serrote 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail do Serrote 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, com partida e chegada no Campo e Pavilh\u00e3o Desportivo de Val das Cavadas, em Vila Nova de Monsarros, concelho de Anadia (distrito de Aveiro).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento integra tr\u00eas provas: o Trail de 19 km (1100m D+) e o Mini-Trail de 14 km (700m D+), ambos com partida conjunta em sa\u00edda din\u00e2mica \u00e0s 09:00, e a Caminhada de 12 km (400m D+) com partida \u00e0s 09:20.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail do Serrote 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 8 de mar\u00e7o de 2027 em quatro fases: no Trail 19 km custam 18\u20ac (at\u00e9 30\/11\/2026), 20\u20ac (at\u00e9 31\/12\/2026), 21\u20ac (at\u00e9 20\/02\/2027) e 23\u20ac (at\u00e9 08\/03\/2027); no Mini-Trail 14 km variam entre 15\u20ac, 17\u20ac, 19\u20ac e 20\u20ac; e na Caminhada 12 km variam entre 14\u20ac, 15\u20ac, 16\u20ac e 17\u20ac.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e a que horas funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona no Pavilh\u00e3o Desportivo de Val das Cavadas em Vila Nova de Monsarros no s\u00e1bado, 13 de mar\u00e7o, das 16:00 \u00e0s 19:00, e no domingo, dia da prova, das 07:30 \u00e0s 08:45.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui T-shirt oficial do evento, dorsal, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, dois abastecimentos no Trail (e um no Mini-Trail e Caminhada, com conv\u00edvio na aldeia de Algeriz), seguro desportivo, banhos e almo\u00e7o completo com bifana \u00e0 moda das Tr\u00eas Mentiras, caldo verde, bebida e caf\u00e9.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67064,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[34,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-69631","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-vila-nova-de-monsarros-anadia","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-aveiro","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/trail-do-serrote-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/69631","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=69631"}],"version-h